===Etymology===
{{PIE word|en|h₁néwn̥}}
From {{inh|en|enm|nyne}}, {{m|enm|nine}}, from {{inh|en|ang|nigon|t=nine}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*neun}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*newun|t=nine}}, from {{inh|en|ine-pro|*h₁néwn̥|t=nine}}. Cognate with {{cog|sco|neen}}, {{m|sco|nine|t=nine}}, {{cog|stq|njúgen|t=nine}}, {{cog|fy|njoggen|t=nine}}, {{cog|nl|negen|t=nine}}, {{cog|nds-de|negen|t=nine}}, {{cog|de|neun|t=nine}}, {{cog|da|ni|t=nine}}, {{cog|sv|nio|t=nine}}, {{cog|is|níu|t=nine}}, {{cog|got|𐌽𐌹𐌿𐌽|t=nine}}, {{cog|la|novem|t=nine}}, {{cog|grc|ἐννέα|t=nine}}, {{cog|sa|नवन्|t=nine}}.

